DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 18 sp
 ots left\nStatus: You are Confirmed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhou
 se.com/events/199492\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5:30PM Program\nBefore the spot
 light turns to the annual Earthshot Innovation Challenge Award Ceremony at
  the John F. Kennedy Presidential Library this winter\, The 'Quin Impact F
 und invites members to an exclusive first look at the next generation of c
 limate innovation.\n\nDuring this special preview\, Earthshot Innovation C
 hallenge semi-finalists will present their breakthrough concepts\, sharing
  bold ideas designed to address some of the world's most pressing environm
 ental challenges. Members will hear each pitch\, engage with the ideas\, a
 nd cast their votes in real time to select the solution they wish to prope
 l into the challenge finals\, securing at least $25\,000 in grant funding\
 , and raising their chances to be awarded the top prize of $100\,000.\n\nT
 his exclusive event offers a unique opportunity to experience the innovati
 on process firsthand while helping elevate promising solutions before they
  take the stage at the formal competition. Be among the first to discover 
 the visionary entrepreneurs shaping a more sustainable future - and play a
  role in recognizing the ideas with the greatest potential to create lasti
 ng impact.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only.
  Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask
  that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of th
 e event.
